[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-253
TITLE: Enable window switching after emission delivery
STATEMENT: >>>
.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
       autonumber
       actor User
       
       box Application
           participant OperatePlanViewModelBase
           participant MainBoardModel
           participant UIStateMachine
           participant TabControl
       end

       Note over OperatePlanViewModelBase, TabControl: "Plan is loaded and confirmed, Board is in Ready state"
       
       alt "[Emission]"
           User->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: BeamOn
           activate OperatePlanViewModelBase
           OperatePlanViewModelBase->>MainBoardModel: BeamOn
           activate MainBoardModel
           Note over MainBoardModel: command HW to start emission
           MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
           Note over MainBoardModel: "wait for Staged state"
           MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
           
           MainBoardModel-->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: BeamOn task result
           deactivate MainBoardModel
           OperatePlanViewModelBase->>User: "ClearPlan?"
           deactivate OperatePlanViewModelBase
       end

       User->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: ClearPlan
       activate OperatePlanViewModelBase
       OperatePlanViewModelBase->>MainBoardModel: ClearPlan
       activate MainBoardModel
       Note over MainBoardModel: command HW to clear plan
       MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
       Note over MainBoardModel: "wait for Primed state"
       MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
       
       MainBoardModel-->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: ClearPlan task result
       deactivate MainBoardModel

       OperatePlanViewModelBase->>UIStateMachine: unlock tabs
       activate UIStateMachine
       UIStateMachine->>TabControl: notify on lock flag change
       activate TabControl
       Note over TabControl: enable tab switch
       TabControl->>TabControl: 
       TabControl-->>UIStateMachine: 
       deactivate TabControl
       UIStateMachine-->>OperatePlanViewModelBase: 
       deactivate UIStateMachine
       deactivate OperatePlanViewModelBase
   </pre>
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-52
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-277
TITLE: Get Interlocks state
STATEMENT: >>>
The interlocks view model reads semantic interlock values from the latest immutable
telemetry snapshot. Each interlock is represented as ready, active, or unavailable so that
fields omitted by calibration firmware are not presented as healthy.

.. raw:: html

    <pre class="mermaid">
    sequenceDiagram
        participant InterlocksView
        participant InterlocksViewModel
        participant GCBDataStore
        participant MainBoardModel

        activate InterlocksView
        InterlocksView->>InterlocksViewModel: Show interlocks
        activate InterlocksViewModel
        
        MainBoardModel->>GCBDataStore: Set SystemTelemetry
        activate GCBDataStore
        GCBDataStore->>GCBDataStore: Notify SystemTelemetry changed
        deactivate GCBDataStore
        
        InterlocksViewModel->>GCBDataStore: Read SystemTelemetry.Interlocks
        GCBDataStore-->>InterlocksViewModel: Return tri-state interlocks
        
        InterlocksViewModel-->>InterlocksView: Render available interlocks
        deactivate InterlocksViewModel
        deactivate InterlocksView
    </pre>
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-139
  ROLE: Refines

