[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-259
TITLE: Perform Quality Checks
STATEMENT: >>>
The flow for performing Daily Quality Checks should be implemented as described in the following sequence diagram:

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
       autonumber
       actor User
       
       box Application
           participant QualityCheckViewModel
           participant MainBoardModel
           participant QcbReadingModel
       end
       box QualityCheckBoard
           participant Firmware
       end

       Note over QualityCheckViewModel: build list of QC configurations
       QualityCheckViewModel->>QualityCheckViewModel: 
       
       User->>QualityCheckViewModel: select collimator type and energy
       Note over QualityCheckViewModel: update view
       QualityCheckViewModel-->>User: 
       
       User->>QualityCheckViewModel: select full/custom QC plan mode
       
       alt "[full QC plan mode]"
           Note over QualityCheckViewModel: build a complete list of points
           QualityCheckViewModel->>QualityCheckViewModel: 
           Note over QualityCheckViewModel: make the list readonly
           QualityCheckViewModel->>QualityCheckViewModel: 
       else "[custom QC plan mode]"
           Note over QualityCheckViewModel: build a list of central points
           QualityCheckViewModel->>QualityCheckViewModel: 
           Note over QualityCheckViewModel: make the list editable
           QualityCheckViewModel->>QualityCheckViewModel: 
       end

       Note over QualityCheckViewModel: enable Prepare button
       
       alt "[custom QC plan mode]"
           User->>QualityCheckViewModel: add/delete points
       end

       User->>QualityCheckViewModel: Prepare
       activate QualityCheckViewModel
       
       QualityCheckViewModel->>QcbReadingModel: connection check
       activate QcbReadingModel
       QcbReadingModel->>Firmware: "[UDP] ping"
       activate Firmware
       Firmware-->>QcbReadingModel: "[UDP] status response"
       deactivate Firmware
       QcbReadingModel-->>QualityCheckViewModel: connection status
       deactivate QcbReadingModel

       QualityCheckViewModel->>MainBoardModel: Load plan
       activate MainBoardModel
       Note over MainBoardModel: "create session, stage and confirm the plan"
       MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
       MainBoardModel-->>QualityCheckViewModel: task result
       deactivate MainBoardModel

       Note over QualityCheckViewModel: enable BeamOn button
       QualityCheckViewModel-->>User: 
       deactivate QualityCheckViewModel
   </pre>
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-66
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-260
TITLE: Perform System Safety Checks
STATEMENT: >>>
The flow for performing System Safety Checks should be implemented as described in the following sequence diagram:

.. raw:: html

   <pre class="mermaid">
   sequenceDiagram
       autonumber
       actor User
       
       box Application
           participant SafetyCheckViewModel
           participant SafetyCheckModel
           participant MainBoardModel
       end
       box Record & Verify
           participant SafetyCheckService
       end

       SafetyCheckViewModel->>SafetyCheckModel: fetch SafetyCheck reports
       activate SafetyCheckViewModel
       activate SafetyCheckModel
       SafetyCheckModel->>SafetyCheckService: grpc: read report list
       activate SafetyCheckService
       SafetyCheckService-->>SafetyCheckModel: grpc: stored reports
       deactivate SafetyCheckService
       SafetyCheckModel-->>SafetyCheckViewModel: 
       deactivate SafetyCheckModel

       alt "[SafetyCheck is allowed with current collimator type]"
           Note over SafetyCheckViewModel: prepare SafetyCheck emission plan for single point
           SafetyCheckViewModel->>SafetyCheckViewModel: 
           Note over SafetyCheckViewModel: enable Prepare button
           
           User->>SafetyCheckViewModel: Prepare
           SafetyCheckViewModel->>MainBoardModel: load emission plan
           activate MainBoardModel
           
           Note over MainBoardModel: send plan and confirmation to ControlBoard
           MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
           Note over MainBoardModel: wait for Ready state
           MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
           
           MainBoardModel-->>SafetyCheckViewModel: task status
           deactivate MainBoardModel
           Note over SafetyCheckViewModel: enable BeamOn button
           
           loop "[User starts/stops/resumes emission]"
               Note over SafetyCheckViewModel: make checks one by one
               SafetyCheckViewModel->>SafetyCheckViewModel: 
               Note over SafetyCheckViewModel: toggle check UI controls
           end
           
           User->>SafetyCheckViewModel: save SafetyCheck report
           SafetyCheckViewModel->>SafetyCheckModel: add new record
           activate SafetyCheckModel
           
           SafetyCheckModel->>SafetyCheckService: create new record
           activate SafetyCheckService
           SafetyCheckService-->>SafetyCheckModel: stored record
           deactivate SafetyCheckService
           
           Note over SafetyCheckModel: add record to the list
           SafetyCheckModel->>SafetyCheckModel: 
           SafetyCheckModel-->>SafetyCheckViewModel: 
           deactivate SafetyCheckModel
           
           SafetyCheckViewModel->>MainBoardModel: clear plan
           activate MainBoardModel
           Note over MainBoardModel: send ResetTimers/ClearPlan commands to ControlBoard
           MainBoardModel->>MainBoardModel: 
           MainBoardModel-->>SafetyCheckViewModel: task status
           deactivate MainBoardModel
           
           Note over SafetyCheckViewModel: navigate to SafetyCheck reports view
           SafetyCheckViewModel->>SafetyCheckViewModel: 
           SafetyCheckViewModel-->>User: 
       end
       deactivate SafetyCheckViewModel
   </pre>
<<<
