[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-254
TITLE: Treatment Fields Emission Progress indicators
STATEMENT: >>>
Emission progress consumes the immutable semantic snapshots published from unsolicited
telemetry. The operational-point index updates the selected treatment field and collimator.
During emission the timer values determine emission progress; during launching the heater
current setpoint determines launching progress.

.. raw:: html

    <pre class="mermaid">
    sequenceDiagram
        participant VM as OperatePlanViewModelBase
        participant CC as CollimatorControl
        participant TFL as TreatmentFieldList
        participant EP as EmissionProgress
        participant DS as GCBDataStore

        DS-->>VM: SystemTelemetryChanged(immutable snapshot)
        VM->>VM: Read CurrentOperationalPoint
        VM->>CC: Update selection
        VM->>TFL: Update selection
        alt Emission state
            VM->>VM: Calculate emission progress from timers
            VM->>EP: Set emission progress
        else Launching state
            VM->>VM: Calculate launching progress from heater setpoint
            VM->>EP: Set launching progress
        end
    </pre>
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-4
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-10
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-248
TITLE: Treatment Staging Sequence
STATEMENT: >>>

.. raw:: html

    <pre class="mermaid">
    sequenceDiagram
        box Application
            participant M as MainBoardModel
        end
        box ControlBoard
            participant F as Firmware
        end

        Note over M, F: Board is in Primed state, User initiates plan preparation

        M->>F: [UDP] create a new session for N operational points
        activate F
        F-->>M: [UDP] session key
        deactivate F

        M->>M: wait for Staging board state

        loop for each operational point
            M->>F: [UDP] send operational parameters
            activate F
            F-->>M: [UDP] status response
            deactivate F
        end

        M->>F: [UDP] Stage command
        activate F
        F-->>M: [UDP] status response
        deactivate F

        M->>M: wait for Staged board state
    </pre>
<<<
